      p: ['Nefertari was the principal queen of Ramesses II. This is a copy of a painting in her tomb in the Valley of the Queens, made inside the tomb in 1921–22; even the cracks and losses of the wall were copied.', 'The queen sits before a board and plays senet against an invisible opponent. Painted in a tomb, the game is thought to have meant more than play: winning the journey into the afterlife.'],
